    "briefSummary": "Three-arm open, randomized comparative study of acetazolamide, dexamethasone, or no additional treatment to evaluate decrease in peri-calcification edema in neurocysticercosis",
    "detailedDescription": "This study will evaluate 24 patients with calcified NCC and edema in three treatment arms to compare the reduction in edema volume"
